WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.595
The end of a traffic jam grows backwards. Using traffic-flow theory, SENDA calculates how fast.

2
00:00:06.945 --> 00:00:12.321
So it warns you where the queue will be when you get there, not where it was, and you slow down much earlier.

3
00:00:13.921 --> 00:00:18.294
SENDA: the channel that remains when everything else fails. Try it on the web.
